func seconds_to_text(seconds):
    if seconds is 0:
        return "0 seconds"
    minutes = floor(seconds / 60)
    secs = seconds % 60
    if minutes is 0:
        return "0 minutes " + str(secs)
    else:
        return str(minutes) + " minutes " + str(secs)

say seconds_to_text(150)
say seconds_to_text(45)
```

This function calculates minutes and seconds, then formats them into the string "X minutes Y seconds". It calls the function twice to display the results on separate lines.

